{"type":"turn_start"}
{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Translation reference annotation\n\nReview every supplied item in its given order. Compare the source and target, using bounded_fixed_context only as evidence for meaning, placeholders, runtime behavior, speaker intent, and register. Do not infer facts that the supplied fields do not support.\n\nAssign exactly one label to every item:\n\n- CLEAN: the target has no material translation defect supported by the supplied evidence.\n- SURFACE_VISIBLE_DEFECT: a material defect is visible from source and target without relying on bounded context.\n- CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_DEFECT: a material defect is established only with the bounded context.\n- UNRESOLVED: the supplied evidence is insufficient for a determinate label.\n\nFor every item, provide a concise evidence statement. A defect label requires one or more bounded defect atoms. Each atom must state its kind, claim, and supporting evidence. For CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_DEFECT, source_evidence_sha256s must cite the supplied source_evidence[].sha256 for that same item; do not calculate, invent, substitute, or cite any other hash. Each source_evidence text is byte-equal to the corresponding item's bounded_fixed_context, and its lowercase SHA-256 is over the exact UTF-8 bytes of text. CLEAN must have no defect atoms, source-evidence hashes, or limitations. Surface-visible defects must have no source-evidence hashes or limitations. Context-dependent defects must have no limitations. UNRESOLVED must state a non-empty limitation.\n\nReturn exactly one JSON document conforming to the supplied response schema. Take response schema_version, status, parent_queue_sha256, and shard_file_sha256 from the response schema consts. Take shard_id, item_count, item_ids, and item order from the shard. Do not add fields or prose outside the JSON document.\n\nINPUT JSON:\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"route-familiarity-reference-collection-shard-v1\",\n  \"status\": \"FROZEN_ZERO_INFERENCE_UNPOPULATED\",\n  \"parent_queue_sha256\": \"620b736996ac254c43b3c721cdbfca20f7e68d8f553b7fe21b9effa0c025b3d2\",\n  \"shard_id\": \"SHARD-04\",\n  \"item_count\": 29,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0093\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"A BETTER NEW MIND.\",\n      \"target\": \"一个更美好的全新心智。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'A BETTER NEW MIND' = mind, not soul\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0094\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"the power that shall now lead me to my rightful place over the Giants, the Orcs, and Nature itself!\",\n      \"target\": \"这种力量，将会带领我们登上凌驾于巨人、兽人乃至自然本身之上的应有位置！\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'rightful place over the Giants, the Orcs, and Nature itself' = dominance above them, not winning a place back FROM them\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0095\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"i can't keep stalling the conquest\",\n      \"target\": \"我不能继续拖延征服大业\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'i can't keep stalling the conquest' (panicked inner monologue) = can't keep delaying, not 'can't give up the expedition plan'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0096\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"The cracks on Mal'Rok and the other Spellblaze-blasted planets in other systems are still slowly fading\",\n      \"target\": \"玛·洛克以及其他星系里被魔法大爆炸轰击的行星上的裂缝，仍在慢慢消散。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'The cracks on Mal'Rok and the other Spellblaze-blasted planets' = cracks ON the planets, not cracks surrounding them\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0097\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"No charge from me - if you accept it, it'll pay for itself.\",\n      \"target\": \"我不收你的钱——只要你愿意用，这笔投入很快就能回本。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'if you accept it, it'll pay for itself' = the item/deal pays for its own cost, not 'it benefits me a lot'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0098\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"we're still losing a few letters going through the mailing system\",\n      \"target\": \"我们的邮递系统仍然会丢失几封信\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'we're still losing a few letters' = a few, not 'large amounts of mail'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0099\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"a rotting human hand in a black leather glove, severed at the wrist\",\n      \"target\": \"一只被黑色皮手套包裹的腐烂的人手，手腕被切断了\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'a rotting human hand' = one hand (severed at the wrist, singular), not 'a pair of hands'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0100\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"It also committed its lot of atrocities and destructions.\",\n      \"target\": \"你的种族也曾犯下许多暴行，造成无数破坏。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'It also committed its lot of atrocities and destructions' - old invented '复仇' (revenge), not in source\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0101\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"All their strongholds in Var'Eyal have been destroyed either by the Sunwall or the one you name the Scourge of the West.\",\n      \"target\": \"你们在瓦·埃亚尔所有的据点不是被太阳堡垒摧毁，就是被你们称作西方灾星的那个人摧毁。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'destroyed either by the Sunwall or the one you name the Scourge of the West' - old changed either/or to 'and', invented 'almost', dropped 'the one you name'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0102\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"the peninsula itself is home to an advanced race of aggressive giants who mastered steam technology\",\n      \"target\": \"半岛本身则居住着一个掌握先进蒸汽科技、充满侵略性的巨人种族\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'an advanced race of aggressive giants who mastered steam technology' - old invented '智慧' (wise/intelligent), not a separate quality in source\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0103\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"the giants have dug a tunnel through the mountains right into Kruk, pouring out of it to end the Pride once and for all while the bulk of Kruk forces are away\",\n      \"target\": \"巨人从山脉中挖出了一条直通克鲁克的隧道，正从中涌出，要在克鲁克的大部分军队离开时一劳永逸地终结这个部落。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'pouring out of it to end the Pride... while the bulk of Kruk forces are away' - restores the giants pouring out of the tunnel imagery\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0104\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"They must be stopped at any cost, if Kruk falls the Orc race dies with it.\",\n      \"target\": \"必须不惜一切代价阻止他们；如果克鲁克沦陷，兽人种族也将随之灭亡。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'They must be stopped' = stopped/repelled, not '终结' (eliminated/ended)\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0105\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"highly evolved bipedal animals they still lack true sentience\",\n      \"target\": \"他们仍然缺乏真正的意识\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'lack true sentience' = sentience/consciousness, not '智力' (intelligence)\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0106\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"transferring their own mind into them to increase the Pride's fighting power\",\n      \"target\": \"将他们自己的意识转移进去来强化部落的战斗力\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'transferring their own mind into them' = mind, not '灵魂' (soul)\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0107\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Psionics without a living mind was never thought possible.\",\n      \"target\": \"没有生命心智的灵能从未被认为可能存在。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Psionics without a living mind was never thought possible' - old completely changed the subject to 'machine-triggered psionics'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0108\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"You have found extremely old machines powered by advanced psionics and technology.\",\n      \"target\": \"你找到了一些由先进灵能与科技驱动的极其古老的机器。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'extremely old machines' is plural and 'advanced', old said a single plain old machine\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0109\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Enter a psionic gestalt with your steam generators, boosting them\",\n      \"target\": \"与你的蒸汽发生器进入灵能格式塔，从而强化它们。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Enter a psionic gestalt with your steam generators, boosting them' - 'them' = the generators, not the character\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0110\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"At this point, it should go without saying that reckless use of magic is a dire threat to...  everything, more or less.\",\n      \"target\": \"说到这里，鲁莽地使用魔法是对……世间一切的可怕威胁，这一点本应不言自明。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'reckless use of magic is a dire threat to... everything, this should go without saying' - old inverted this into 'we must ABANDON the view that magic is dangerous', contradicting the rest of the passage which argues magic IS dangerous\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0111\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Affected by toxic chemicals. Has %d%% talent failure, %d%% reduced healing, and takes %0.2f additional acid damage from melee and ranged attacks.\",\n      \"target\": \"被有毒化学物质影响。 %d%% 技能失败率，降低 %d%% 治疗效果，每回合第一次被带有武器类型的近战或远程攻击命中时，受到额外 %0.2f 酸性伤害。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Miasma=瘴气. The cloud string on the previous key is a different entry and was not changed. EFF_MIASMA.callbackOnHit (timed_effects/physical.lua) returns unless src.turn_procs.weapon_type and not self.turn_procs.miasma, then sets self.turn_procs.miasma and projects acid. T_MIASMA_ENGINE info says the first time each turn a melee or ranged attack hits.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0112\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"%d corrosive flechettes are embedded in the target. Each melee and ranged attack against them will cause a flechette to burst for %0.2f acid damage\",\n      \"target\": \"目标体内嵌有 %d 枚腐蚀性毒镖。敌方单位的近战或远程攻击命中目标时，其中一枚毒镖会爆裂，造成 %0.2f 点酸性伤害。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Corrosive Flechette=腐蚀性毒镖. EFF_CORROSIVE_FLECHETTE.callbackOnMeleeHit/callbackOnArcheryHit (timed_effects/physical.lua) burst one flechette and skip if src==self, src dead, self:reactionToward(src)>=0, or src is not an actor. Automated Defenses boltgun (talents/steam/heavy-weapons.lua) applies the effect only when the shield attack hit is true.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0114\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"All resistances increased by %d%%, randomly attacks two foes each turn at random.\",\n      \"target\": \"全部抗性提高 %d%%，两把蒸汽枪每回合各自随机选择一名敌人攻击（可能攻击同一目标），持有者被缴械。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Awesome Toss=致命翻转. EFF_AWESOME_TOSS.activate (timed_effects/physical.lua) sets resists.all and disarmed. callbackOnActBase independently rng.table-picks a hostile for main steamgun and offhand steamgun, so both shots may hit the same actor. T_AWESOME_TOSS info says you are disarmed and cannot attack. All Resists terminology is 全部抗性 (resists.all), not 全体抗性.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0115\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"The target has been impregnated with %d developing ritch larvae which are feeding on it%s.  After a %d turn gestation period, each will burst out violently, dealing %0.2f physical and %0.2f fire damage to its host.\",\n      \"target\": \"目标被 %d 个里奇幼虫寄生%s。在%d回合的发育期结束后，每个幼虫都会从寄主体内猛烈破体而出，对宿主造成 %0.2f 物理和 %0.2f 火焰伤害；即使效果提前解除，幼虫仍可能以较低强度破体而出并生成幼虫。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Larvae Infestation=里奇幼虫寄生; developing =正在生长的; A %s BURSTS OUT of %s%s. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_RITCH_LARVA_EGGS.deactivate: if prematurely removed (eff.dur>=0) hatch chance is below 100% and strength is reduced; each larva still rng.percent(chance) may deal moltenrock damage and spawn a ritch larva NPC in an adjacent tile. NPC apply path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/misc/npcs.lua Ritch Larva Infect sets the effect on a living target after a melee hit.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0116\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Increases steamsaw damage multiplier by %d%%.\",\n      \"target\": \"当前使蒸汽链锯伤害增加 %d%%；每回合首次近战命中指定目标时提高此加成，命中其他敌人则效果结束。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Continuous Butchery=无尽屠戮. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_CONTINUOUS_BUTCHERY: activate immediately applies current steamsaw_dam_mult from eff.power; callbackOnMeleeAttack miss does nothing, a hit on a different actor removes the effect, and the first successful melee hit each turn on the designated target increases eff.power by power_inc. Combat path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/superload/mod/class/interface/Combat.lua adds steamsaw_dam_mult/100 only for steamsaw weapons. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/automated-butchery.lua Continuous Butchery sets designated target plus initial/increment for 5 turns.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0117\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Deals %0.2f occult damage per turn and each time a talent is used, the caster regens one turn of a random cooldown.\",\n      \"target\": \"每回合施加者沿至多10格的链接射线，对射线上的生物造成 %0.2f 玄机伤害；施加者不存在或距离超过10格时效果结束且不造成伤害；目标使用非固有技能时，施加者优先随机缩短一个冷却中的科技法术1回合，没有则随机缩短一个冷却中的法术1回合。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Ethereal Steam=虚幻蒸汽; technomancy=科技法术. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/magical.lua EFF_ETHEREAL_STEAM: callbackOnTalentPost ignores innate talents then randomly reduces one cooling-down is_technomancy talent by 1, else falls back to is_spell; on_timeout removes the effect with no damage if caster missing or distance>10, otherwise projects a range-10 occult beam to the host. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/spells/occult-technomancy.lua Ethereal Steam on hostiles with Congeal Time. Random pick among matching cooldowns is talentCooldownFilter in <MAIN_GAME_ROOT>/game/modules/tome/class/Actor.lua.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0118\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"You have %d%% chances to encase your foes in iceblocks.\",\n      \"target\": \"你造成伤害时有 %d%% 几率将敌人封入冰块 3 回合；效果持续期间，冰块吸收的伤害降低 50%。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Algid Rage=寒冰之怒. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_ALGID_RAGE: callbackOnDealDamage skips already-dead targets then rng.percent(eff.power) applies EFF_FROZEN for 3 turns; activate sets iceblock_pierce to 50. Core combat <MAIN_GAME_ROOT>/game/modules/tome/class/Actor.lua reduces iceblock absorb by iceblock_pierce percent, so 50 means iceblocks absorb 50% less from this actor. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/misc/races.lua Algid Rage for 5 turns.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0119\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Continuously drain blood, dealing %0.2f physical damage per turn and healing the caster for half of it.\",\n      \"target\": \"持续汲取目标的鲜血，每回合造成 %0.2f 点物理伤害；若施加者距离过远、死亡或不在场，链接立即断开且本回合不造成伤害；造成伤害后，施加者获得相当于该伤害一半的治疗，同回合每多一个目标，治疗量在前一目标基础上再减半。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Bloodstar=血液灵晶. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_BLOODSTAR.on_timeout: if distance to caster >= eff.free, or caster is dead or not on the map, the effect is removed and this turn deals no damage; otherwise physical damage is dealt and caster heals realdam * 0.5^n with n starting at 1 this turn, so first victim heals half and each additional same-turn victim is halved again. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/mechstar.lua Bloodstar.applyOn via Metalstar; eff.free is twice Metalstar radius.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0120\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Storing damage to unleash as a powerful lightning bolt (%d/%d).\",\n      \"target\": \"已格挡伤害可累积至上限，准备放出强力闪电（%d/%d）。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Capacitor Discharge=电力放出; lightning=闪电. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/other.lua EFF_CAPACITOR_DISCHARGE: long_desc shows current power over max_power; on_merge adds successive power and caps at max_power. Apply path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/magnetism.lua Capacitor Discharge callbackOnBlock sets power to the actual blocked amount. Damage type is LIGHTNING.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0121\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"All stats increased by %d.\",\n      \"target\": \"除力量外的所有属性增加 %d。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Pain Enhancement System=痛苦强化系统; #Target# revels in the pain.=#Target# 在苦痛中狂欢。 EFF_PAIN_ENHANCEMENT_SYSTEM.activate (tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua) sets inc_stats only for STAT_DEX/MAG/WIL/CUN/CON; STAT_STR is absent. Granting talent T_PAIN_ENHANCEMENT_SYSTEM info (talents/uber/str.lua) says: increasing all your primary stats except Strength by 50% of your Strength for 6 turns. English key occurs once in pinned Orcs source (this long_desc).\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0122\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"The target is surrounded by a magical steam shield, absorbing %d/%d damage and burning attackers for %d fire damage before it crumbles.\",\n      \"target\": \"目标被魔法蒸汽护盾包围，吸收 %d/%d 伤害，并在攻击者近战命中时对其造成 %d 点火焰反击伤害。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Steam Shield=蒸汽护盾. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/magical.lua EFF_STEAM_SHIELD.activate registers on_melee_hit fire damage of eff.retaliate; ranged hits do not trigger. Item apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua personal steam barrier.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"source_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0093\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0093\",\n      \"sha256\": \"66c410e57cb38525ae8e1b8e75ca4293e81bea79f64cb801c33b5790612563c4\",\n      \"text\": \"'A BETTER NEW MIND' = mind, not soul\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0094\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0094\",\n      \"sha256\": \"14f1754bc0d5d72d79eec78e1ffb111c6fb0d5d412a03da6d61ca8d937ee4d76\",\n      \"text\": \"'rightful place over the Giants, the Orcs, and Nature itself' = dominance above them, not winning a place back FROM them\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0095\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0095\",\n      \"sha256\": \"27aff9c6dde9cab7724ed1c96f693d8fe9feedfdb11d78370f15f4f1dbb835fa\",\n      \"text\": \"'i can't keep stalling the conquest' (panicked inner monologue) = can't keep delaying, not 'can't give up the expedition plan'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0096\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0096\",\n      \"sha256\": \"9dc05dc3a8f993a5dffe3ad3ce2f916d53e722fddca96f70f362f12e76117a8a\",\n      \"text\": \"'The cracks on Mal'Rok and the other Spellblaze-blasted planets' = cracks ON the planets, not cracks surrounding them\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0097\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0097\",\n      \"sha256\": \"4a75ae213cc94361c225330c5a198c295c2beea7817e2a4cd1696cc39148e6f3\",\n      \"text\": \"'if you accept it, it'll pay for itself' = the item/deal pays for its own cost, not 'it benefits me a lot'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0098\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0098\",\n      \"sha256\": \"aedbaf292c7436251ded1d8edeeefba60d4c3c9608bb11aa4e98ba1265329379\",\n      \"text\": \"'we're still losing a few letters' = a few, not 'large amounts of mail'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0099\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0099\",\n      \"sha256\": \"16bf074e0bba5db33da73e7278ed31e9ffff726ec53ca12b7a09dfd15991e6b3\",\n      \"text\": \"'a rotting human hand' = one hand (severed at the wrist, singular), not 'a pair of hands'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0100\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0100\",\n      \"sha256\": \"793d2b0e0bc95497858865f8f95b4398bc47bd0956bbf9776a670878bcf68a20\",\n      \"text\": \"'It also committed its lot of atrocities and destructions' - old invented '复仇' (revenge), not in source\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0101\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0101\",\n      \"sha256\": \"45e446c22da7a13809dba9a25e7fea4f8067d15329408513e80565c2b61a15c1\",\n      \"text\": \"'destroyed either by the Sunwall or the one you name the Scourge of the West' - old changed either/or to 'and', invented 'almost', dropped 'the one you name'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0102\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0102\",\n      \"sha256\": \"89c8bb465fb242ad463f0634e70902d8a9680a3211ced79aca152d9c3eb16d9f\",\n      \"text\": \"'an advanced race of aggressive giants who mastered steam technology' - old invented '智慧' (wise/intelligent), not a separate quality in source\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0103\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0103\",\n      \"sha256\": \"4a6389c6e7dd3bfbd35cb57326c70c788a7d3bb04dfbd56ce7fbe1eaaebe4062\",\n      \"text\": \"'pouring out of it to end the Pride... while the bulk of Kruk forces are away' - restores the giants pouring out of the tunnel imagery\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0104\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0104\",\n      \"sha256\": \"238e7a37415788ea1740409533bc6b9cf9812006c87b60c4de63e2f7ef8949b7\",\n      \"text\": \"'They must be stopped' = stopped/repelled, not '终结' (eliminated/ended)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0105\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0105\",\n      \"sha256\": \"b26d55a56cffef96916f7e1d1056d2489ed2da33f2b44c55779b93e1042a34ac\",\n      \"text\": \"'lack true sentience' = sentience/consciousness, not '智力' (intelligence)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0106\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0106\",\n      \"sha256\": \"10e452dc72c303c3d04c1c31ee7137175d596ad8b4536b5ee497de8da3d7221a\",\n      \"text\": \"'transferring their own mind into them' = mind, not '灵魂' (soul)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0107\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0107\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f37c02b451859f9d98c42e89a661abe4725b745460a79164d6c42398d5fdf8f0\",\n      \"text\": \"'Psionics without a living mind was never thought possible' - old completely changed the subject to 'machine-triggered psionics'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0108\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0108\",\n      \"sha256\": \"00611c1d23f6f7cd4040f2c181c17ea72a510099ea61123ee6e0155ef48af81f\",\n      \"text\": \"'extremely old machines' is plural and 'advanced', old said a single plain old machine\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0109\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0109\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f5756b2b02367f92c7001084b72a79f9b93b391ca1b2b55abff5aea0e8c72002\",\n      \"text\": \"'Enter a psionic gestalt with your steam generators, boosting them' - 'them' = the generators, not the character\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0110\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0110\",\n      \"sha256\": \"eaa48f8e6f4a8c99dafa1e4114d30894ae5fca2953f23d2c97187bbf912ee3ff\",\n      \"text\": \"'reckless use of magic is a dire threat to... everything, this should go without saying' - old inverted this into 'we must ABANDON the view that magic is dangerous', contradicting the rest of the passage which argues magic IS dangerous\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0111\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0111\",\n      \"sha256\": \"3858a28df8009381697fa0d8dee6e290a9499a6d0654392a9fe7f0e99f98682f\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Miasma=瘴气. The cloud string on the previous key is a different entry and was not changed. EFF_MIASMA.callbackOnHit (timed_effects/physical.lua) returns unless src.turn_procs.weapon_type and not self.turn_procs.miasma, then sets self.turn_procs.miasma and projects acid. T_MIASMA_ENGINE info says the first time each turn a melee or ranged attack hits.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0112\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0112\",\n      \"sha256\": \"5605ff001eda44f07559e17913dd7df811be0018a7cc98e2f94f1e5b06eb227b\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Corrosive Flechette=腐蚀性毒镖. EFF_CORROSIVE_FLECHETTE.callbackOnMeleeHit/callbackOnArcheryHit (timed_effects/physical.lua) burst one flechette and skip if src==self, src dead, self:reactionToward(src)>=0, or src is not an actor. Automated Defenses boltgun (talents/steam/heavy-weapons.lua) applies the effect only when the shield attack hit is true.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0114\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0114\",\n      \"sha256\": \"b32b3d7253f22894a4feee970993819aa109f7556817f42dc34d6f8d962f1dc1\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Awesome Toss=致命翻转. EFF_AWESOME_TOSS.activate (timed_effects/physical.lua) sets resists.all and disarmed. callbackOnActBase independently rng.table-picks a hostile for main steamgun and offhand steamgun, so both shots may hit the same actor. T_AWESOME_TOSS info says you are disarmed and cannot attack. All Resists terminology is 全部抗性 (resists.all), not 全体抗性.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0115\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0115\",\n      \"sha256\": \"a0c7151af9e7224df867674b12611502c0c4a1069b410ec9415c0bcc61345086\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Larvae Infestation=里奇幼虫寄生; developing =正在生长的; A %s BURSTS OUT of %s%s. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_RITCH_LARVA_EGGS.deactivate: if prematurely removed (eff.dur>=0) hatch chance is below 100% and strength is reduced; each larva still rng.percent(chance) may deal moltenrock damage and spawn a ritch larva NPC in an adjacent tile. NPC apply path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/misc/npcs.lua Ritch Larva Infect sets the effect on a living target after a melee hit.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0116\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0116\",\n      \"sha256\": \"d6eeb19dbdb4e6afe523168657d2af834ba49a4330a227690f33e4a530791a37\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Continuous Butchery=无尽屠戮. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_CONTINUOUS_BUTCHERY: activate immediately applies current steamsaw_dam_mult from eff.power; callbackOnMeleeAttack miss does nothing, a hit on a different actor removes the effect, and the first successful melee hit each turn on the designated target increases eff.power by power_inc. Combat path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/superload/mod/class/interface/Combat.lua adds steamsaw_dam_mult/100 only for steamsaw weapons. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/automated-butchery.lua Continuous Butchery sets designated target plus initial/increment for 5 turns.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0117\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0117\",\n      \"sha256\": \"5a6c4d2858e505ba7564d23d3f78efa7c35b6e4ae0323e50a7bb0ad2eb3f5e2e\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Ethereal Steam=虚幻蒸汽; technomancy=科技法术. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/magical.lua EFF_ETHEREAL_STEAM: callbackOnTalentPost ignores innate talents then randomly reduces one cooling-down is_technomancy talent by 1, else falls back to is_spell; on_timeout removes the effect with no damage if caster missing or distance>10, otherwise projects a range-10 occult beam to the host. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/spells/occult-technomancy.lua Ethereal Steam on hostiles with Congeal Time. Random pick among matching cooldowns is talentCooldownFilter in <MAIN_GAME_ROOT>/game/modules/tome/class/Actor.lua.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0118\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0118\",\n      \"sha256\": \"c4d344a2a67605e8be8be632ab433c5a7b9886d343d637e43ea6af3042bdc9ff\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Algid Rage=寒冰之怒. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_ALGID_RAGE: callbackOnDealDamage skips already-dead targets then rng.percent(eff.power) applies EFF_FROZEN for 3 turns; activate sets iceblock_pierce to 50. Core combat <MAIN_GAME_ROOT>/game/modules/tome/class/Actor.lua reduces iceblock absorb by iceblock_pierce percent, so 50 means iceblocks absorb 50% less from this actor. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/misc/races.lua Algid Rage for 5 turns.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0119\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0119\",\n      \"sha256\": \"993f684ffa7125a336da6785a765d0e97e2fd342928743a514b7022795a7646e\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Bloodstar=血液灵晶. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_BLOODSTAR.on_timeout: if distance to caster >= eff.free, or caster is dead or not on the map, the effect is removed and this turn deals no damage; otherwise physical damage is dealt and caster heals realdam * 0.5^n with n starting at 1 this turn, so first victim heals half and each additional same-turn victim is halved again. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/mechstar.lua Bloodstar.applyOn via Metalstar; eff.free is twice Metalstar radius.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0120\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0120\",\n      \"sha256\": \"11cae5cf0fb02e245554a6df66ab99af32c1f39823fc6aa6c613b3c8b7b652eb\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Capacitor Discharge=电力放出; lightning=闪电. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/other.lua EFF_CAPACITOR_DISCHARGE: long_desc shows current power over max_power; on_merge adds successive power and caps at max_power. Apply path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/magnetism.lua Capacitor Discharge callbackOnBlock sets power to the actual blocked amount. Damage type is LIGHTNING.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0121\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0121\",\n      \"sha256\": \"e688a31896cbd079247da4e6814cf06e06ff09f4f4010bb6d4041542cd3bd3bc\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Pain Enhancement System=痛苦强化系统; #Target# revels in the pain.=#Target# 在苦痛中狂欢。 EFF_PAIN_ENHANCEMENT_SYSTEM.activate (tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua) sets inc_stats only for STAT_DEX/MAG/WIL/CUN/CON; STAT_STR is absent. Granting talent T_PAIN_ENHANCEMENT_SYSTEM info (talents/uber/str.lua) says: increasing all your primary stats except Strength by 50% of your Strength for 6 turns. English key occurs once in pinned Orcs source (this long_desc).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0122\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0122\",\n      \"sha256\": \"bc597bd8425b1f1f54a7d658c020498eac8639b90c3aba4a4f2d1aedc0a7a350\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Steam Shield=蒸汽护盾. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/magical.lua EFF_STEAM_SHIELD.activate registers on_melee_hit fire damage of eff.retaliate; ranged hits do not trigger. Item apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua personal steam barrier.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"timestamp":1787939755182}}
{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Translation reference annotation\n\nReview every supplied item in its given order. Compare the source and target, using bounded_fixed_context only as evidence for meaning, placeholders, runtime behavior, speaker intent, and register. Do not infer facts that the supplied fields do not support.\n\nAssign exactly one label to every item:\n\n- CLEAN: the target has no material translation defect supported by the supplied evidence.\n- SURFACE_VISIBLE_DEFECT: a material defect is visible from source and target without relying on bounded context.\n- CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_DEFECT: a material defect is established only with the bounded context.\n- UNRESOLVED: the supplied evidence is insufficient for a determinate label.\n\nFor every item, provide a concise evidence statement. A defect label requires one or more bounded defect atoms. Each atom must state its kind, claim, and supporting evidence. For CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_DEFECT, source_evidence_sha256s must cite the supplied source_evidence[].sha256 for that same item; do not calculate, invent, substitute, or cite any other hash. Each source_evidence text is byte-equal to the corresponding item's bounded_fixed_context, and its lowercase SHA-256 is over the exact UTF-8 bytes of text. CLEAN must have no defect atoms, source-evidence hashes, or limitations. Surface-visible defects must have no source-evidence hashes or limitations. Context-dependent defects must have no limitations. UNRESOLVED must state a non-empty limitation.\n\nReturn exactly one JSON document conforming to the supplied response schema. Take response schema_version, status, parent_queue_sha256, and shard_file_sha256 from the response schema consts. Take shard_id, item_count, item_ids, and item order from the shard. Do not add fields or prose outside the JSON document.\n\nINPUT JSON:\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"route-familiarity-reference-collection-shard-v1\",\n  \"status\": \"FROZEN_ZERO_INFERENCE_UNPOPULATED\",\n  \"parent_queue_sha256\": \"620b736996ac254c43b3c721cdbfca20f7e68d8f553b7fe21b9effa0c025b3d2\",\n  \"shard_id\": \"SHARD-04\",\n  \"item_count\": 29,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0093\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"A BETTER NEW MIND.\",\n      \"target\": \"一个更美好的全新心智。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'A BETTER NEW MIND' = mind, not soul\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0094\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"the power that shall now lead me to my rightful place over the Giants, the Orcs, and Nature itself!\",\n      \"target\": \"这种力量，将会带领我们登上凌驾于巨人、兽人乃至自然本身之上的应有位置！\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'rightful place over the Giants, the Orcs, and Nature itself' = dominance above them, not winning a place back FROM them\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0095\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"i can't keep stalling the conquest\",\n      \"target\": \"我不能继续拖延征服大业\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'i can't keep stalling the conquest' (panicked inner monologue) = can't keep delaying, not 'can't give up the expedition plan'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0096\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"The cracks on Mal'Rok and the other Spellblaze-blasted planets in other systems are still slowly fading\",\n      \"target\": \"玛·洛克以及其他星系里被魔法大爆炸轰击的行星上的裂缝，仍在慢慢消散。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'The cracks on Mal'Rok and the other Spellblaze-blasted planets' = cracks ON the planets, not cracks surrounding them\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0097\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"No charge from me - if you accept it, it'll pay for itself.\",\n      \"target\": \"我不收你的钱——只要你愿意用，这笔投入很快就能回本。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'if you accept it, it'll pay for itself' = the item/deal pays for its own cost, not 'it benefits me a lot'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0098\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"we're still losing a few letters going through the mailing system\",\n      \"target\": \"我们的邮递系统仍然会丢失几封信\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'we're still losing a few letters' = a few, not 'large amounts of mail'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0099\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"a rotting human hand in a black leather glove, severed at the wrist\",\n      \"target\": \"一只被黑色皮手套包裹的腐烂的人手，手腕被切断了\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'a rotting human hand' = one hand (severed at the wrist, singular), not 'a pair of hands'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0100\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"It also committed its lot of atrocities and destructions.\",\n      \"target\": \"你的种族也曾犯下许多暴行，造成无数破坏。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'It also committed its lot of atrocities and destructions' - old invented '复仇' (revenge), not in source\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0101\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"All their strongholds in Var'Eyal have been destroyed either by the Sunwall or the one you name the Scourge of the West.\",\n      \"target\": \"你们在瓦·埃亚尔所有的据点不是被太阳堡垒摧毁，就是被你们称作西方灾星的那个人摧毁。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'destroyed either by the Sunwall or the one you name the Scourge of the West' - old changed either/or to 'and', invented 'almost', dropped 'the one you name'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0102\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"the peninsula itself is home to an advanced race of aggressive giants who mastered steam technology\",\n      \"target\": \"半岛本身则居住着一个掌握先进蒸汽科技、充满侵略性的巨人种族\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'an advanced race of aggressive giants who mastered steam technology' - old invented '智慧' (wise/intelligent), not a separate quality in source\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0103\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"the giants have dug a tunnel through the mountains right into Kruk, pouring out of it to end the Pride once and for all while the bulk of Kruk forces are away\",\n      \"target\": \"巨人从山脉中挖出了一条直通克鲁克的隧道，正从中涌出，要在克鲁克的大部分军队离开时一劳永逸地终结这个部落。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'pouring out of it to end the Pride... while the bulk of Kruk forces are away' - restores the giants pouring out of the tunnel imagery\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0104\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"They must be stopped at any cost, if Kruk falls the Orc race dies with it.\",\n      \"target\": \"必须不惜一切代价阻止他们；如果克鲁克沦陷，兽人种族也将随之灭亡。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'They must be stopped' = stopped/repelled, not '终结' (eliminated/ended)\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0105\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"highly evolved bipedal animals they still lack true sentience\",\n      \"target\": \"他们仍然缺乏真正的意识\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'lack true sentience' = sentience/consciousness, not '智力' (intelligence)\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0106\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"transferring their own mind into them to increase the Pride's fighting power\",\n      \"target\": \"将他们自己的意识转移进去来强化部落的战斗力\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'transferring their own mind into them' = mind, not '灵魂' (soul)\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0107\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Psionics without a living mind was never thought possible.\",\n      \"target\": \"没有生命心智的灵能从未被认为可能存在。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Psionics without a living mind was never thought possible' - old completely changed the subject to 'machine-triggered psionics'\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0108\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"You have found extremely old machines powered by advanced psionics and technology.\",\n      \"target\": \"你找到了一些由先进灵能与科技驱动的极其古老的机器。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'extremely old machines' is plural and 'advanced', old said a single plain old machine\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0109\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"Enter a psionic gestalt with your steam generators, boosting them\",\n      \"target\": \"与你的蒸汽发生器进入灵能格式塔，从而强化它们。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'Enter a psionic gestalt with your steam generators, boosting them' - 'them' = the generators, not the character\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0110\",\n      \"category\": \"Dialogue\",\n      \"profile\": \"dialogue\",\n      \"source\": \"At this point, it should go without saying that reckless use of magic is a dire threat to...  everything, more or less.\",\n      \"target\": \"说到这里，鲁莽地使用魔法是对……世间一切的可怕威胁，这一点本应不言自明。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"'reckless use of magic is a dire threat to... everything, this should go without saying' - old inverted this into 'we must ABANDON the view that magic is dangerous', contradicting the rest of the passage which argues magic IS dangerous\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0111\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Affected by toxic chemicals. Has %d%% talent failure, %d%% reduced healing, and takes %0.2f additional acid damage from melee and ranged attacks.\",\n      \"target\": \"被有毒化学物质影响。 %d%% 技能失败率，降低 %d%% 治疗效果，每回合第一次被带有武器类型的近战或远程攻击命中时，受到额外 %0.2f 酸性伤害。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Miasma=瘴气. The cloud string on the previous key is a different entry and was not changed. EFF_MIASMA.callbackOnHit (timed_effects/physical.lua) returns unless src.turn_procs.weapon_type and not self.turn_procs.miasma, then sets self.turn_procs.miasma and projects acid. T_MIASMA_ENGINE info says the first time each turn a melee or ranged attack hits.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0112\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"%d corrosive flechettes are embedded in the target. Each melee and ranged attack against them will cause a flechette to burst for %0.2f acid damage\",\n      \"target\": \"目标体内嵌有 %d 枚腐蚀性毒镖。敌方单位的近战或远程攻击命中目标时，其中一枚毒镖会爆裂，造成 %0.2f 点酸性伤害。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Corrosive Flechette=腐蚀性毒镖. EFF_CORROSIVE_FLECHETTE.callbackOnMeleeHit/callbackOnArcheryHit (timed_effects/physical.lua) burst one flechette and skip if src==self, src dead, self:reactionToward(src)>=0, or src is not an actor. Automated Defenses boltgun (talents/steam/heavy-weapons.lua) applies the effect only when the shield attack hit is true.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0114\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"All resistances increased by %d%%, randomly attacks two foes each turn at random.\",\n      \"target\": \"全部抗性提高 %d%%，两把蒸汽枪每回合各自随机选择一名敌人攻击（可能攻击同一目标），持有者被缴械。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Awesome Toss=致命翻转. EFF_AWESOME_TOSS.activate (timed_effects/physical.lua) sets resists.all and disarmed. callbackOnActBase independently rng.table-picks a hostile for main steamgun and offhand steamgun, so both shots may hit the same actor. T_AWESOME_TOSS info says you are disarmed and cannot attack. All Resists terminology is 全部抗性 (resists.all), not 全体抗性.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0115\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"The target has been impregnated with %d developing ritch larvae which are feeding on it%s.  After a %d turn gestation period, each will burst out violently, dealing %0.2f physical and %0.2f fire damage to its host.\",\n      \"target\": \"目标被 %d 个里奇幼虫寄生%s。在%d回合的发育期结束后，每个幼虫都会从寄主体内猛烈破体而出，对宿主造成 %0.2f 物理和 %0.2f 火焰伤害；即使效果提前解除，幼虫仍可能以较低强度破体而出并生成幼虫。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Larvae Infestation=里奇幼虫寄生; developing =正在生长的; A %s BURSTS OUT of %s%s. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_RITCH_LARVA_EGGS.deactivate: if prematurely removed (eff.dur>=0) hatch chance is below 100% and strength is reduced; each larva still rng.percent(chance) may deal moltenrock damage and spawn a ritch larva NPC in an adjacent tile. NPC apply path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/misc/npcs.lua Ritch Larva Infect sets the effect on a living target after a melee hit.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0116\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Increases steamsaw damage multiplier by %d%%.\",\n      \"target\": \"当前使蒸汽链锯伤害增加 %d%%；每回合首次近战命中指定目标时提高此加成，命中其他敌人则效果结束。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Continuous Butchery=无尽屠戮. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_CONTINUOUS_BUTCHERY: activate immediately applies current steamsaw_dam_mult from eff.power; callbackOnMeleeAttack miss does nothing, a hit on a different actor removes the effect, and the first successful melee hit each turn on the designated target increases eff.power by power_inc. Combat path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/superload/mod/class/interface/Combat.lua adds steamsaw_dam_mult/100 only for steamsaw weapons. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/automated-butchery.lua Continuous Butchery sets designated target plus initial/increment for 5 turns.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0117\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Deals %0.2f occult damage per turn and each time a talent is used, the caster regens one turn of a random cooldown.\",\n      \"target\": \"每回合施加者沿至多10格的链接射线，对射线上的生物造成 %0.2f 玄机伤害；施加者不存在或距离超过10格时效果结束且不造成伤害；目标使用非固有技能时，施加者优先随机缩短一个冷却中的科技法术1回合，没有则随机缩短一个冷却中的法术1回合。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Ethereal Steam=虚幻蒸汽; technomancy=科技法术. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/magical.lua EFF_ETHEREAL_STEAM: callbackOnTalentPost ignores innate talents then randomly reduces one cooling-down is_technomancy talent by 1, else falls back to is_spell; on_timeout removes the effect with no damage if caster missing or distance>10, otherwise projects a range-10 occult beam to the host. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/spells/occult-technomancy.lua Ethereal Steam on hostiles with Congeal Time. Random pick among matching cooldowns is talentCooldownFilter in <MAIN_GAME_ROOT>/game/modules/tome/class/Actor.lua.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0118\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"You have %d%% chances to encase your foes in iceblocks.\",\n      \"target\": \"你造成伤害时有 %d%% 几率将敌人封入冰块 3 回合；效果持续期间，冰块吸收的伤害降低 50%。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Algid Rage=寒冰之怒. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_ALGID_RAGE: callbackOnDealDamage skips already-dead targets then rng.percent(eff.power) applies EFF_FROZEN for 3 turns; activate sets iceblock_pierce to 50. Core combat <MAIN_GAME_ROOT>/game/modules/tome/class/Actor.lua reduces iceblock absorb by iceblock_pierce percent, so 50 means iceblocks absorb 50% less from this actor. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/misc/races.lua Algid Rage for 5 turns.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0119\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Continuously drain blood, dealing %0.2f physical damage per turn and healing the caster for half of it.\",\n      \"target\": \"持续汲取目标的鲜血，每回合造成 %0.2f 点物理伤害；若施加者距离过远、死亡或不在场，链接立即断开且本回合不造成伤害；造成伤害后，施加者获得相当于该伤害一半的治疗，同回合每多一个目标，治疗量在前一目标基础上再减半。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Bloodstar=血液灵晶. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_BLOODSTAR.on_timeout: if distance to caster >= eff.free, or caster is dead or not on the map, the effect is removed and this turn deals no damage; otherwise physical damage is dealt and caster heals realdam * 0.5^n with n starting at 1 this turn, so first victim heals half and each additional same-turn victim is halved again. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/mechstar.lua Bloodstar.applyOn via Metalstar; eff.free is twice Metalstar radius.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0120\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"Storing damage to unleash as a powerful lightning bolt (%d/%d).\",\n      \"target\": \"已格挡伤害可累积至上限，准备放出强力闪电（%d/%d）。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Capacitor Discharge=电力放出; lightning=闪电. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/other.lua EFF_CAPACITOR_DISCHARGE: long_desc shows current power over max_power; on_merge adds successive power and caps at max_power. Apply path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/magnetism.lua Capacitor Discharge callbackOnBlock sets power to the actual blocked amount. Damage type is LIGHTNING.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0121\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"All stats increased by %d.\",\n      \"target\": \"除力量外的所有属性增加 %d。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Pain Enhancement System=痛苦强化系统; #Target# revels in the pain.=#Target# 在苦痛中狂欢。 EFF_PAIN_ENHANCEMENT_SYSTEM.activate (tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua) sets inc_stats only for STAT_DEX/MAG/WIL/CUN/CON; STAT_STR is absent. Granting talent T_PAIN_ENHANCEMENT_SYSTEM info (talents/uber/str.lua) says: increasing all your primary stats except Strength by 50% of your Strength for 6 turns. English key occurs once in pinned Orcs source (this long_desc).\",\n      \"response\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0122\",\n      \"category\": \"Runtime-focused\",\n      \"profile\": \"mechanics\",\n      \"source\": \"The target is surrounded by a magical steam shield, absorbing %d/%d damage and burning attackers for %d fire damage before it crumbles.\",\n      \"target\": \"目标被魔法蒸汽护盾包围，吸收 %d/%d 伤害，并在攻击者近战命中时对其造成 %d 点火焰反击伤害。\",\n      \"bounded_fixed_context\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Steam Shield=蒸汽护盾. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/magical.lua EFF_STEAM_SHIELD.activate registers on_melee_hit fire damage of eff.retaliate; ranged hits do not trigger. Item apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua personal steam barrier.\",\n      \"response\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"source_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0093\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0093\",\n      \"sha256\": \"66c410e57cb38525ae8e1b8e75ca4293e81bea79f64cb801c33b5790612563c4\",\n      \"text\": \"'A BETTER NEW MIND' = mind, not soul\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0094\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0094\",\n      \"sha256\": \"14f1754bc0d5d72d79eec78e1ffb111c6fb0d5d412a03da6d61ca8d937ee4d76\",\n      \"text\": \"'rightful place over the Giants, the Orcs, and Nature itself' = dominance above them, not winning a place back FROM them\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0095\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0095\",\n      \"sha256\": \"27aff9c6dde9cab7724ed1c96f693d8fe9feedfdb11d78370f15f4f1dbb835fa\",\n      \"text\": \"'i can't keep stalling the conquest' (panicked inner monologue) = can't keep delaying, not 'can't give up the expedition plan'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0096\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0096\",\n      \"sha256\": \"9dc05dc3a8f993a5dffe3ad3ce2f916d53e722fddca96f70f362f12e76117a8a\",\n      \"text\": \"'The cracks on Mal'Rok and the other Spellblaze-blasted planets' = cracks ON the planets, not cracks surrounding them\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0097\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0097\",\n      \"sha256\": \"4a75ae213cc94361c225330c5a198c295c2beea7817e2a4cd1696cc39148e6f3\",\n      \"text\": \"'if you accept it, it'll pay for itself' = the item/deal pays for its own cost, not 'it benefits me a lot'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0098\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0098\",\n      \"sha256\": \"aedbaf292c7436251ded1d8edeeefba60d4c3c9608bb11aa4e98ba1265329379\",\n      \"text\": \"'we're still losing a few letters' = a few, not 'large amounts of mail'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0099\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0099\",\n      \"sha256\": \"16bf074e0bba5db33da73e7278ed31e9ffff726ec53ca12b7a09dfd15991e6b3\",\n      \"text\": \"'a rotting human hand' = one hand (severed at the wrist, singular), not 'a pair of hands'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0100\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0100\",\n      \"sha256\": \"793d2b0e0bc95497858865f8f95b4398bc47bd0956bbf9776a670878bcf68a20\",\n      \"text\": \"'It also committed its lot of atrocities and destructions' - old invented '复仇' (revenge), not in source\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0101\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0101\",\n      \"sha256\": \"45e446c22da7a13809dba9a25e7fea4f8067d15329408513e80565c2b61a15c1\",\n      \"text\": \"'destroyed either by the Sunwall or the one you name the Scourge of the West' - old changed either/or to 'and', invented 'almost', dropped 'the one you name'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0102\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0102\",\n      \"sha256\": \"89c8bb465fb242ad463f0634e70902d8a9680a3211ced79aca152d9c3eb16d9f\",\n      \"text\": \"'an advanced race of aggressive giants who mastered steam technology' - old invented '智慧' (wise/intelligent), not a separate quality in source\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0103\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0103\",\n      \"sha256\": \"4a6389c6e7dd3bfbd35cb57326c70c788a7d3bb04dfbd56ce7fbe1eaaebe4062\",\n      \"text\": \"'pouring out of it to end the Pride... while the bulk of Kruk forces are away' - restores the giants pouring out of the tunnel imagery\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0104\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0104\",\n      \"sha256\": \"238e7a37415788ea1740409533bc6b9cf9812006c87b60c4de63e2f7ef8949b7\",\n      \"text\": \"'They must be stopped' = stopped/repelled, not '终结' (eliminated/ended)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0105\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0105\",\n      \"sha256\": \"b26d55a56cffef96916f7e1d1056d2489ed2da33f2b44c55779b93e1042a34ac\",\n      \"text\": \"'lack true sentience' = sentience/consciousness, not '智力' (intelligence)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0106\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0106\",\n      \"sha256\": \"10e452dc72c303c3d04c1c31ee7137175d596ad8b4536b5ee497de8da3d7221a\",\n      \"text\": \"'transferring their own mind into them' = mind, not '灵魂' (soul)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0107\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0107\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f37c02b451859f9d98c42e89a661abe4725b745460a79164d6c42398d5fdf8f0\",\n      \"text\": \"'Psionics without a living mind was never thought possible' - old completely changed the subject to 'machine-triggered psionics'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0108\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0108\",\n      \"sha256\": \"00611c1d23f6f7cd4040f2c181c17ea72a510099ea61123ee6e0155ef48af81f\",\n      \"text\": \"'extremely old machines' is plural and 'advanced', old said a single plain old machine\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0109\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0109\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f5756b2b02367f92c7001084b72a79f9b93b391ca1b2b55abff5aea0e8c72002\",\n      \"text\": \"'Enter a psionic gestalt with your steam generators, boosting them' - 'them' = the generators, not the character\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0110\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0110\",\n      \"sha256\": \"eaa48f8e6f4a8c99dafa1e4114d30894ae5fca2953f23d2c97187bbf912ee3ff\",\n      \"text\": \"'reckless use of magic is a dire threat to... everything, this should go without saying' - old inverted this into 'we must ABANDON the view that magic is dangerous', contradicting the rest of the passage which argues magic IS dangerous\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0111\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0111\",\n      \"sha256\": \"3858a28df8009381697fa0d8dee6e290a9499a6d0654392a9fe7f0e99f98682f\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Miasma=瘴气. The cloud string on the previous key is a different entry and was not changed. EFF_MIASMA.callbackOnHit (timed_effects/physical.lua) returns unless src.turn_procs.weapon_type and not self.turn_procs.miasma, then sets self.turn_procs.miasma and projects acid. T_MIASMA_ENGINE info says the first time each turn a melee or ranged attack hits.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0112\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0112\",\n      \"sha256\": \"5605ff001eda44f07559e17913dd7df811be0018a7cc98e2f94f1e5b06eb227b\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Corrosive Flechette=腐蚀性毒镖. EFF_CORROSIVE_FLECHETTE.callbackOnMeleeHit/callbackOnArcheryHit (timed_effects/physical.lua) burst one flechette and skip if src==self, src dead, self:reactionToward(src)>=0, or src is not an actor. Automated Defenses boltgun (talents/steam/heavy-weapons.lua) applies the effect only when the shield attack hit is true.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0114\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0114\",\n      \"sha256\": \"b32b3d7253f22894a4feee970993819aa109f7556817f42dc34d6f8d962f1dc1\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Awesome Toss=致命翻转. EFF_AWESOME_TOSS.activate (timed_effects/physical.lua) sets resists.all and disarmed. callbackOnActBase independently rng.table-picks a hostile for main steamgun and offhand steamgun, so both shots may hit the same actor. T_AWESOME_TOSS info says you are disarmed and cannot attack. All Resists terminology is 全部抗性 (resists.all), not 全体抗性.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0115\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0115\",\n      \"sha256\": \"a0c7151af9e7224df867674b12611502c0c4a1069b410ec9415c0bcc61345086\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Larvae Infestation=里奇幼虫寄生; developing =正在生长的; A %s BURSTS OUT of %s%s. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_RITCH_LARVA_EGGS.deactivate: if prematurely removed (eff.dur>=0) hatch chance is below 100% and strength is reduced; each larva still rng.percent(chance) may deal moltenrock damage and spawn a ritch larva NPC in an adjacent tile. NPC apply path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/misc/npcs.lua Ritch Larva Infect sets the effect on a living target after a melee hit.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0116\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0116\",\n      \"sha256\": \"d6eeb19dbdb4e6afe523168657d2af834ba49a4330a227690f33e4a530791a37\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Continuous Butchery=无尽屠戮. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_CONTINUOUS_BUTCHERY: activate immediately applies current steamsaw_dam_mult from eff.power; callbackOnMeleeAttack miss does nothing, a hit on a different actor removes the effect, and the first successful melee hit each turn on the designated target increases eff.power by power_inc. Combat path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/superload/mod/class/interface/Combat.lua adds steamsaw_dam_mult/100 only for steamsaw weapons. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/automated-butchery.lua Continuous Butchery sets designated target plus initial/increment for 5 turns.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0117\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0117\",\n      \"sha256\": \"5a6c4d2858e505ba7564d23d3f78efa7c35b6e4ae0323e50a7bb0ad2eb3f5e2e\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Ethereal Steam=虚幻蒸汽; technomancy=科技法术. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/magical.lua EFF_ETHEREAL_STEAM: callbackOnTalentPost ignores innate talents then randomly reduces one cooling-down is_technomancy talent by 1, else falls back to is_spell; on_timeout removes the effect with no damage if caster missing or distance>10, otherwise projects a range-10 occult beam to the host. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/spells/occult-technomancy.lua Ethereal Steam on hostiles with Congeal Time. Random pick among matching cooldowns is talentCooldownFilter in <MAIN_GAME_ROOT>/game/modules/tome/class/Actor.lua.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0118\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0118\",\n      \"sha256\": \"c4d344a2a67605e8be8be632ab433c5a7b9886d343d637e43ea6af3042bdc9ff\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Algid Rage=寒冰之怒. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_ALGID_RAGE: callbackOnDealDamage skips already-dead targets then rng.percent(eff.power) applies EFF_FROZEN for 3 turns; activate sets iceblock_pierce to 50. Core combat <MAIN_GAME_ROOT>/game/modules/tome/class/Actor.lua reduces iceblock absorb by iceblock_pierce percent, so 50 means iceblocks absorb 50% less from this actor. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/misc/races.lua Algid Rage for 5 turns.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0119\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0119\",\n      \"sha256\": \"993f684ffa7125a336da6785a765d0e97e2fd342928743a514b7022795a7646e\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Bloodstar=血液灵晶. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua EFF_BLOODSTAR.on_timeout: if distance to caster >= eff.free, or caster is dead or not on the map, the effect is removed and this turn deals no damage; otherwise physical damage is dealt and caster heals realdam * 0.5^n with n starting at 1 this turn, so first victim heals half and each additional same-turn victim is halved again. Talent apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/mechstar.lua Bloodstar.applyOn via Metalstar; eff.free is twice Metalstar radius.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0120\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0120\",\n      \"sha256\": \"11cae5cf0fb02e245554a6df66ab99af32c1f39823fc6aa6c613b3c8b7b652eb\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Capacitor Discharge=电力放出; lightning=闪电. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/other.lua EFF_CAPACITOR_DISCHARGE: long_desc shows current power over max_power; on_merge adds successive power and caps at max_power. Apply path <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/magnetism.lua Capacitor Discharge callbackOnBlock sets power to the actual blocked amount. Damage type is LIGHTNING.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0121\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0121\",\n      \"sha256\": \"e688a31896cbd079247da4e6814cf06e06ff09f4f4010bb6d4041542cd3bd3bc\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Pain Enhancement System=痛苦强化系统; #Target# revels in the pain.=#Target# 在苦痛中狂欢。 EFF_PAIN_ENHANCEMENT_SYSTEM.activate (tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua) sets inc_stats only for STAT_DEX/MAG/WIL/CUN/CON; STAT_STR is absent. Granting talent T_PAIN_ENHANCEMENT_SYSTEM info (talents/uber/str.lua) says: increasing all your primary stats except Strength by 50% of your Strength for 6 turns. English key occurs once in pinned Orcs source (this long_desc).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"EVIDENCE-RFR-0122\",\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0122\",\n      \"sha256\": \"bc597bd8425b1f1f54a7d658c020498eac8639b90c3aba4a4f2d1aedc0a7a350\",\n      \"text\": \"source_tag=tformat; unique runtime key in tome-orcs.lua. Nearby: Steam Shield=蒸汽护盾. Public source <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/magical.lua EFF_STEAM_SHIELD.activate registers on_melee_hit fire damage of eff.retaliate; ranged hits do not trigger. Item apply <DLC_ROOT>/orcs/tome-orcs/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua personal steam barrier.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"timestamp":1787939755182}}
